OL,3,GNEWSANew #15m museum charts history of
OL,4,ARoyal Marines
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new #15m museum charting more than
OL,7,F360 years of Royal Marines history is
OL,8,Fdue to open in Portsmouth.
OL,10,FThe Royal Marines Experience in the
OL,11,Fcity's Historic Dockyard is the new
OL,12,Fhome for the Royal Marines Museum,
OL,13,Fformerly based at Eastney before it
OL,14,Fclosed in 2017.
OL,16,FExhibits include all 10 Victoria
OL,17,FCrosses awarded to the Royal Marines,
OL,18,Fwhile a Remembrance room allows
OL,19,Ffamilies to reflect on those who lost
OL,20,Ftheir lives in service.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
